      "updated": 1794321912946,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\"If your tests are hard to write, it's probably because your code sucks\"\n\"Testing is easy in the presence of good design\"\n\n\"Angular is overused\"\n\"Angular is under-utilized - it's not used *enough*\"",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\"If your tests are hard to write, it's probably because your code sucks\"\n\"Testing is easy in the presence of good design\"\n\n\"Angular is overused\"\n\"Angular is under-utilized - it's not used *enough*\"",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
